@Mango Bay (Brooklyn, NY) is a new Afro-Caribbean restaurant in the heart of Brooklyn🔥 They serve a large variety of fusion dishes and both their brunch and dinner menus are incredible! This restaurant has a patio for outdoor seating and an incredible ambiance💫 I checked out their brunch menu and I have to say this might be the best brunch I’ve had in the city😮‍💨 Make sure you try the shrimp and grits and truffle aioli burger!

