@verassoulfood in Brooklyn is serving some of the best soul food around. Everything is made fresh with homemade sauces, including what might be my favorite BBQ sauce anywhere.

The turkey wings are a must and you can get them tossed in Honey Garlic, Firecracker, or BBQ. The sides are just as good, especially the greens and mac and cheese.

